@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@baseUrl2 = http://localhost:3000

### 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl2}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test5@test.com",
  "name": "테스트유저",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl2}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### 이메일 중복 테스트
POST {{baseUrl2}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "name": "중복유저",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### 비밀번호 오류 테스트
POST {{baseUrl2}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 로그아웃 (Authorization 헤더에 accessToken 필요)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
